    LLM: '1. Deal 3 hole cards. 2. Pre-flop betting. 3. Flop (3 cards). 4. Betting. 5. Turn (1 card). 6. Betting. 7. River (1 card). 8. Betting. 9. Showdown. Restriction: Use 0, 1, or 2 hole cards. You cannot use all 3. (Unlike Omaha where you must use 2, or Pineapple where you discard one).',
